#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:3 eeea37d4b3504cff865f98a2128cebd9
msgid "Relay Management"
msgstr "继电器管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:9 75c4a88edbd043109f17d75deb961855
msgid "Control the operation of the output servos."
msgstr "控制输出舵机的运作。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:11 f9925878406d4678869d0e50ac697576
msgid ""
"Note this should only be used for the non-flight-control servos. An example "
"of usage would be camera shutter controls. Use ``servo set [SERVO_NUM] "
"[PWM]`` to set an output servo to a particular PWM value. Use ``servo repeat"
" [SERVO_NUM] [PWM] [COUNT] [PERIOD]`` to make the servo repeat between its "
"current and specified PWM values."
msgstr ""
"注意此功能仅用于非飞行控制舵机，例如相机快门控制。使用 ``servo set [SERVO_NUM] [PWM]`` 将输出舵机设置为特定 PWM "
"值。使用 ``servo repeat [SERVO_NUM] [PWM] [COUNT] [PERIOD]`` 使舵机在当前值和指定 PWM "
"值之间重复运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:18 f8208c2a66b44f62930df16d4c14d1ce
msgid ""
"If relay controls are available, the ``relay set [RELAY_NUM] [0|1]`` to set "
"a particular relay to 0 or 1. Similar to the servos, use ``relay repeat "
"[RELAY_NUM] [COUNT] [PERIOD]`` to setup a repeating relay."
msgstr ""
"若有继电器控制可用，使用 ``relay set [RELAY_NUM] [0|1]`` 将指定继电器设为 0 或 1。与舵机类似，使用 ``relay"
" repeat [RELAY_NUM] [COUNT] [PERIOD]`` 设置重复继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:23 c6c92d423186458e90a919d13195eb2c
msgid ""
"For running motor tests (useful for multicopters), the ``motortest`` command"
" can be used:"
msgstr "如需进行电机测试（多旋翼飞行器适用），可使用 ``motortest`` 命令："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:30 64c3dceca3eb4975b64ae01722dc6921
msgid ""
"Where the motor number ``motornum`` with type 0 (percent), 1 (PWM) or 2 (RC "
"passthrough) and value depending on the type selection."
msgstr "电机编号 ``motornum``，类型 0（百分比）、1（PWM）或 2（RC 直通），值取决于所选类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:33 a62a15e6f6a14b3b9f2b1a467c15bb92
msgid "Timeout is the number of seconds the test should run for."
msgstr "Timeout 为测试运行的秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/relay.rst:35 86d11cf98d7c4e2aa0133aec87a6aaf5
msgid ""
"Count is an optional parameter specifying how many times the test should run"
" for."
msgstr "Count 为可选参数，指定测试运行次数。"
